                        "entry_id": "0f73da57-004e-34f8-868f-04b1f19a16c4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "As much as a bathtub will hold."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "818cff78-532f-4d90-b88f-fb995e63a497",
                                "sense_id": "ddeb6fa9-44ed-3650-b86d-883f360da021",
                                "text": "We did two small baby bathtubfuls of potatoes, and usually carrots or turnips besides."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8261c44d-f535-4c2c-8a80-c62fe8fcefe3",
                                "sense_id": "ddeb6fa9-44ed-3650-b86d-883f360da021",
                                "text": "“You may bring me a brandy-and-soda. Not a large one. A couple of bathtubsful will be enough.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b8b55aa-630d-4c32-acee-480b88b996ea",
                                "sense_id": "ddeb6fa9-44ed-3650-b86d-883f360da021",
                                "text": "But he [Dr. Dublin] adds: “To absorb a lethal amount of fluoridated water would require drinking 50 bathtubfuls at a sitting • • • To produce even the mildest symptoms of fluoride poisoning would require that the victim swallow two-and-a-half bathtubfuls • • • during a single day.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
